    "### Final Cluster Narrative (RQ1 Conclusion)\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on the empirical evidence and the visual profiles, the `k=6` baseline model successfully segments the bookings into coherent profiles that address our original segmentation question. The numerical heatmap and categorical bar charts reveal:\n",
